Private Agent Systems resources: licensing
=============================================

This repository contains two kinds of material under two different terms.

1. Public-domain material (CC0 1.0)
-----------------------------------
The fill-in templates in `templates/`, the portable files in `starter-kit/`, the
utility scripts in `tools/`, the checks in `tests/`, the machine-readable
artifacts in `evidence/`, and the file `source-register.md` are dedicated to the
public domain under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal. You may copy, modify,
distribute, and use them, including commercially, with no attribution required.
The full dedication text is in `templates/LICENSE`.

One file is carved out: `evidence/token-saving-public-results.md` is written
prose and stays reserved under section 2.

2. Reserved material (all rights reserved)
------------------------------------------
Everything else is the author's reserved work, provided for reading and reference
only. This includes:
  - the prose of the book *Private Agent Systems* by Daniele Verì,
  - supplemental chapter prose in `chapters/`,
  - the explanatory text in the README files of this repository,
  - the written results commentary in `evidence/token-saving-public-results.md`,
  - the cover image in `assets/`.

You may not redistribute or republish the reserved material without permission.

Questions about reuse beyond these terms: open an issue in this repository.
